<title>UK: Roper Starch opens European headquarters in London.</title>
<headline>Roper Starch opens European headquarters in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roper Starch Worldwide, a U.S.-based marketing and advertising research company, on Monday said it opened its European headquarters in London.</p>
<p>Roper Starch also said it formed a strategic alliance with Park Taner Ltd, a British research agency, to provide the platform for launching Roper Starch products and services in the UK and throughout Europe.</p>
<p>-- London Advertising Newsdesk +44 171 542 2815</p>
